 revenue.","The top line has compounded at +620% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -1581% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $564M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","On the balance sheet, thin -3323.8\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and stock-based comp at 239% of revenue is silent dilution an owner has to account for, and insiders hold 32% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (19.8% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Industrials peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 1356% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Insiders are net sellers (100% sell ratio, net $5.6M) \u2014 the people closest to the business are reducing their personal stake","sev":"amber","cat":"insider"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Industrials peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Industrials sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 6% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cyclicality and capital intensity \u2014 order books turn on a dime, and the heavy fixed cost base that creates the moat also magnifies the downturn.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Tariff and trade-policy exposure \u2014 industrial exporters sit squarely in the crosshairs of protectionist policy, and retaliatory tariffs can close markets without warning.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 132% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Growing faster than most Industrials peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Joby Aviation, Inc. $JOBY Holdings Decreased by Pier 88 Investment Partners LLC","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/joby-aviation-inc-joby-holdings-decreased-by-pier-88-investment-partners-llc.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794566960.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.836,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Archer Aviation Slides 6% Despite Cathie Wood\u2019s Second Straight Day of Buying; Joby Aviation Falls 4%, EHang Declines 2% Despite Sri Lanka Milestone","source":"247wallst.com","link":"https://247wallst.com/investing/2026/11/12/archer-aviation-slides-6-despite-cathie-woods-second-straight-day-of-buying-joby-aviation-falls-4-ehang-declines-2-despite-sri-lanka-milestone/","date":"2026-11-12","timestamp":1794502336.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Is Joby Aviation (JOBY) Fairly Valued After Raised Guidance And New Air Force Funding?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/transportation/nyse-joby/joby-aviation/news/is-joby-aviation-joby-fai